      "string_id": "leha_slon_second_dialog_phrase_9",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Oh, I don't have Jumper anymore. I sold it to get money for the bribe, I just didn't know he would ask for that much. Don't be pissed, it's a noble cause.",
      "JA_current": "Oh, I don't have Jumper anymore. I sold it to get money for the bribe, I just didn't know he would ask for that much. Don't be pissed, it's a noble cause.",
      "JA_new": "ああ、ジャンパーはもう持ってない。賄賂の金を作るために売っちまった。あんな大金を要求されるとは思わなかったんだ。怒るなよ。立派な目的のためなんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
